{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":15201,"ns":0,"title":"Interdisciplinarity","extract":"Interdisciplinarity, also known as interdisciplinary studies, is the combination of multiple academic disciplines into one activity (e.g., a research project). It draws knowledge from several fields such as sociology, anthropology, psychology, economics, etc.","description":"Combination of two or more academic disciplines into one activity","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}